  "details": "Description\n\nhitching and drops to 4-8 fps. vrchat only, drop is not shown in any other tools. amd 7945hx, 9060xt 16gb, quest 3s via virtual desktop\n\nReproduction Steps\n\namd 7945hx with 9060xt. latest drivers and steam vr. using virtual desktop and ovr toolkit. i have zero hitching in any others apps but vrchat hitches and drops from 90 fps to less than 10 fps. all audio input and output cuts but visuals drop to under 10 fps. after 4-12 seconds it returns to perfect.\n\nDetails\n\n- Category: Performance\n\n- Frequency: Often\n\n---\n\nplatform: PC (platform: Windows, store: Steam, headset: None)\n\nrawPlatform: WindowsPlayer\n\nclientVersion: 2026.3.2p2-1903-5de5614b49-Release\n\nunityVersion: 2022.3.22f2-DWR\n\nIn-Client Report\n\n---\n\n**Log file:** [output_log_2026-09-25_03-05-12.txt](https://api.vrchat.cloud/api/1/file/file_38f2d1cf-a78d-472e-8ff5-0a98255f7c65/1/file)",
